+// Unsafe_IgnoreGlobalMonitor: exclusive accesses without the process-wide monitor lock, as
+// QEMU's user-mode emulation does them. The exclusive read remembers its address and value on
+// the calling host thread; the exclusive write is a compare-and-swap against that value (the
+// UserCallbacks' MemoryWriteExclusive). The JIT state's exclusive_state flag still says whether
+// a reservation is open. Every exclusive access otherwise takes one spin lock shared by all
+// threads, and a thread preempted while holding it stalls every other thread's atomics.
+struct LocalReservation {
+    A32::VAddr vaddr = 0;
+    u64 value = 0;
+};
+static thread_local LocalReservation local_reservation;
